le enabled\n    gateway.controlUi.allowInsecureAuth=true does not bypass secure context or device identity checks; only dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth disables Control UI device…\n    Fix: Disable it or switch to HTTPS (Tailscale Serve) or localhost.\n  WARN Feishu doc create can grant requester permissions\n    channels.feishu tools include \"doc\"; feishu_doc action \"create\" can grant document access to the trusted requesting Feishu user.\n    Fix: Disable channels.feishu.tools.doc when not needed, and restrict tool access for untrusted prompts.\n… +6 more\nFull report: openclaw security audit\nDeep probe: openclaw security audit --deep\n\nChannels\n┌──────────────┬─────────┬────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Channel      │ Enabled │ State  │ Detail                                                                            │\n├──────────────┼─────────┼────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ QQ Bot       │ ON      │ SETUP  │ not configured                                                                    │\n│ Feishu       │ ON      │ OK     │ configured                                                                        │\n│ WeCom        │ OFF     │ OFF    │ disabled                                                                          │\n│ ADP OpenClaw │ ON      │ SETUP  │ not configured                                                                    │\n│ DingTalk     │ ON      │ WARN   │ DingTalk credentials (clientId/clientSecret) not configured · gateway: DingTalk   │\n│              │         │        │ credentials (clientId/clientSecret) not configured                                │\n└──────────────┴─────────┴────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nSessions\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────┬──────────┬──────────────┬───────────────────