next steps afterward to guide things smoothly. I want to make sure I’m clear and helpful! So, let’s keep it simple and effective.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 跑完了，结论先给你：\n\n- **OpenClaw 主体正常**\n  - Feishu: **OK**\n  - 当前会话正常在线\n- **有版本更新**\n  - 当前提示：`Update available (npm 2026.3.13)`\n  - 可执行：`openclaw update`\n- **工作区不是干净状态**\n  - `USER.md` 已修改\n  - 还有一批未跟踪文件：`AGENTS.md / SOUL.md / skills/ / logs/` 等\n- **memory 目录目前是空的**\n  - 还没有日记型记录\n\n我这轮巡检看到的重点问题就两个：\n\n1. **仓库还没整理/提交**\n2. **OpenClaw 有可更新版本**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接继续做其中一个：\n\n- **A. 帮你整理工作区并提交一次 git**\n- **B. 帮你升级 openclaw**\n- **C. 跑更深一轮诊断**（`openclaw status --deep`）\n- **D. 开始初始化 memory / 今日记录**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b8c4291a4881918feac5420bfa0496\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":600,"output":286,"cacheRead":16256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17142,"cost":{"input":0.0015,"output":0.00429,"cacheRead":0.004064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.009854}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773716514159}}
