{"type":"message","id":"1a9b4b40","parentId":"21bc698b","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:04:56.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已处理完。\n\n### 结果\n- **memory 已初始化**\n  - 新建：`MEMORY.md`\n  - 新建：`memory/2026-03-17.md`\n- **工作区已整理**\n  - 新建：`.gitignore`\n  - 忽略了本地运行态文件：\n    - `.openclaw/`\n    - `.clawhub/`\n    - `logs/`\n    - `skills/.skills_store_lock.json`\n    - `.trash/`\n- **BOOTSTRAP 已移走**\n  - 没直接删，挪到可恢复位置：`.trash/BOOTSTRAP.2026-03-17.md`\n- **git 已提交**\n  - 提交号：`c4f15ed`\n  - 提交信息：`Initialize workspace memory and organize tracked files`\n\n### 当前状态\n- 仓库现在是 **干净的**\n- 当前分支：`master`\n\n### 我顺手做的结构\n`MEMORY.md` 里先放了：\n- 用户长期偏好\n- 工作与节奏\n- 当前工作区状态\n- 约束与原则\n\n`memory/2026-03-17.md` 里先记了：\n- 今天初始化了 memory\n- 巡检结果\n- 后续待跟进项\n\n### 一个小问题\n这次 git commit 用的是系统默认身份：\n- `root <root@localhost.localdomain>`\n\n如果你介意，我下一步可以直接帮你设 git identity，然后 **amend** 这次提交。  \n比如我可以继续做这两个动作之一：\n\n1. **补一版更完整的 MEMORY.md**\n2. **设置 git 用户名/邮箱并修正这次提交作者**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b8c4d155e88191b6adf30b1c0a5d40\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":213,"output":381,"cacheRead":21376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21970,"cost":{"input":0.0005325000000000001,"output":0.0057150000000000005,"cacheRead":0.005344,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011591500000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773716687480}}
{"type":"message","id":"bac99bb0","parentId":"1a9b4b40","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:07:34.784Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54b81996f4a0b35f077ec4bc888\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-17 11:07 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54b81996f4a0b35f077ec4bc888]\n范: 1. 补一版更完整的 [MEMORY.md](http://memory.md/)\n2. 设置 git 用户名/邮箱并修正这次提交作者"}],"timestamp":1773716854780}}
