{"type":"message","id":"85f62c6f","parentId":"c041713e","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:08:04.766Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] `MEMORY.md` 已补完整，结构现在够用了，后面可以持续沉淀。\n\n### 现在卡住的唯一点\ngit 作者信息我查了，**当前没配置**：\n\n- global `user.name`：空\n- global `user.email`：空\n- repo local `user.name`：空\n- repo local `user.email`：空\n\n所以我要修这次提交作者，得你给我这两个值：\n\n- **git 用户名**\n- **git 邮箱**\n\n你直接回我一行就行，例如：\n\n```text\n用户名：Fan\n邮箱：fan@example.com\n```\n\n你一发，我就直接帮你做完这 3 步：\n\n1. `git config --global user.name / user.email`\n2. `git commit --amend --reset-author --no-edit`\n3. 再提交一次 `MEMORY.md` 的更新或者一起 amend 进去\n\n如果你不想配全局，我也可以只配当前仓库。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b8c590a61081919f71f35fcfe89758\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":902,"output":223,"cacheRead":23040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24165,"cost":{"input":0.002255,"output":0.003345,"cacheRead":0.0057599999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011359999999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773716878178}}
{"type":"message","id":"b18f7612","parentId":"85f62c6f","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:08:58.070Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54b812435cb8b24d1934c3066c5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-17 11:08 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54b812435cb8b24d1934c3066c5]\n范: 用户名：Fan\n邮箱：fzp000@163.com"}],"timestamp":1773716938065}}
