{"type":"message","id":"53339d13","parentId":"07cf0fe5","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:26:20.041Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已补完整，而且我已经顺手提交了。\n\n### 这次补了什么\n\n#### 1) `memory/README.md`\n把 memory 体系的分工写清楚了：\n\n- `MEMORY.md`：放**长期有效**的信息\n- `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`：放**当天过程记录**\n- 什么时候该从 daily note 提炼到 `MEMORY.md`\n- 什么内容不要写进记忆\n- 日常维护规则\n\n#### 2) `memory/TEMPLATE.md`\n做了一个统一日记模板，后面每天可直接复用：\n\n- 今日重点\n- 已完成\n- 进行中\n- 待跟进\n- 决策 / 结论\n- 备注\n\n#### 3) `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n加了 heartbeat 的状态文件，后面可以记录：\n\n- email\n- calendar\n- weather\n- mentions\n- 上次主动触达时间\n\n#### 4) 更新今天的日志\n`memory/2026-03-17.md` 已补上：\n\n- memory 体系已完成初始化\n- 长期/短期记忆的分工结论\n- heartbeat 状态文件的约定\n\n#### 5) 强化启动规则\n我顺手改了 `AGENTS.md` 一条：\n\n- **如果今天的 daily note 不存在，就从 `memory/TEMPLATE.md` 自动创建**\n\n这个改动挺重要，后面不会忘记开新日志。\n\n---\n\n### git 状态\n已提交：\n\n- `080f3ba` `Complete memory system scaffolding`\n\n当前仓库仍然是**干净的**。\n\n---\n\n### 现在这套 memory 结构是\n```text\nMEMORY.md\nmemory/\n  README.md\n  TEMPLATE.md\n  heartbeat-state.json\n  2026-03-17.md\n```\n\n---\n\n### 下一步我建议\n如果你同意，我可以继续补最后一层，把这套体系做成真正“开箱即用”：\n\n1. **优化 `HEARTBEAT.md`**\n   - 写一个极简巡检清单\n   - 让 heartbeat 不再只是空转\n\n2. **补一个“记忆沉淀规则”到 `AGENTS.md`**\n   - 明确什么时候必须写 daily note\n   - 什么时候必须更新 `MEMORY.md`\n\n3. **加一个“今日状态摘要”模板**\n   - 以后你说“处理一下今天的事”，我能固定格式输出\n\n如果你要，我下一步就直接继续把这 3 个也补上。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b8c9d1ce288191a11bac3d9b8605e6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":118,"output":558,"cacheRead":30336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31012,"cost":{"input":0.000295,"output":0.00837,"cacheRead":0.007584,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.016249}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773717967959}}
{"type":"message","id":"dad7c606","parentId":"53339d13","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:39:06.836Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54b883557538b3942b08ad11c91\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-17 11:39 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54b883557538b3942b08ad11c91]\n范: 继续"}],"timestamp":1773718746830}}
