{"type":"message","id":"3589fc9c","parentId":"4e1f91f0","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:40:07.405Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 继续补完了。现在这套 memory 体系已经不是“能用”，是**顺手、可持续、低维护**了。\n\n### 这次新增\n\n#### 1. `HEARTBEAT.md`\n把 heartbeat 从“空文件占位”改成了可执行规则：\n\n- 每次只检查 1-2 项，避免打扰\n- 优先看：\n  - `calendar`\n  - `email`\n  - `mentions`\n  - `weather`\n- 明确了**什么时候该主动提醒**\n- 明确了**什么时候直接 `HEARTBEAT_OK`**\n- 要求检查后更新 `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\n这一步很关键，不然 heartbeat 很容易变成无效空转。\n\n---\n\n#### 2. `memory/MEMORY-RULES.md`\n把“什么时候记、记到哪”写成规则了：\n\n- **必须写 daily note 的情况**\n  - 用户说“记一下”\n  - 完成阶段性任务\n  - 出现 TODO / 待跟进\n  - 做出关键决策\n  - 遇到坑 / 限制 / 异常 / 经验\n\n- **必须更新 `MEMORY.md` 的情况**\n  - 用户长期偏好变化\n  - 工作节奏变化\n  - 形成可复用工作流\n  - 重要项目背景确认\n  - 旧记忆过时\n\n这能避免后面“该记的没记，不该记的记了一堆”。\n\n---\n\n#### 3. `memory/TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md`\n加了“今日状态摘要”模板。\n\n以后你说一句：\n\n> 处理一下今天的事\n\n我就能稳定按这个结构输出：\n\n- 今日重点\n- 已完成\n- 进行中\n- 待处理\n- 风险 / 阻塞\n- 建议下一步\n\n---\n\n#### 4. `AGENTS.md` 补规则\n我把记忆规则入口也挂进去了：\n\n- 后续会优先遵循 `memory/MEMORY-RULES.md`\n\n这样不会只靠口头约定。\n\n---\n\n#### 5. 更新今天日志\n`memory/2026-03-17.md` 已同步补记这轮工作：\n\n- heartbeat 规则已落地\n- 今日摘要模板已建立\n- 记忆沉淀规则已建立\n\n---\n\n### 已提交\n新提交：\n\n- `bbca8b9` — `Refine memory workflows and heartbeat rules`\n\n当前仓库依然是**干净的**。\n\n---\n\n### 现在完整结构\n```text\nMEMORY.md\nHEARTBEAT.md\nmemory/\n  2026-03-17.md\n  README.md\n  TEMPLATE.md\n  MEMORY-RULES.md\n  TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md\n  heartbeat-state.json\n```\n\n---\n\n### 现在这套体系的实际效果\n你后面再跟我协作，基本已经有这几个能力基础了：\n\n- **长期偏好不会丢**\n- **每天上下文能续上**\n- **heartbeat 不会瞎打扰**\n- **“处理一下今天的事”可以固定格式秒出**\n- **重要信息知道该写 daily 还是写 long-term**\n\n---\n\n如果继续往下做，我建议下一步只剩两个方向了：\n\n1. **跑一轮真实“今日状态摘要”演练**\n   - 直接按新模板输出一次今天状态\n2. **跑一轮 `openclaw status --deep`**\n   - 把运行层也补齐，看看还有没有配置缺口\n\n你要的话，我直接继续，不问第二遍。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b8cd08c9788191bf00e3647f4d71d4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":143,"output":791,"cacheRead":35712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36646,"cost":{"input":0.0003575,"output":0.011865,"cacheRead":0.008928,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021150500000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773718790623}}
{"type":"message","id":"285c0d6d","parentId":"3589fc9c","timestamp":"2026-03-17T12:33:20.760Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54a0ee3a34a0b495afa3476fbd7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-17 20:33 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54a0ee3a34a0b495afa3476fbd7]\n范: 跑一轮 openclaw status --deep"}],"timestamp":1773750800753}}
