*\\n- **当前配置里的端口 = 实际监听端口 = `34459`**\\n- **配置文件最近一次触碰时间不是今天**\\n  - `meta.lastTouchedAt`: `2026-03-14T06:52:08.974Z`\\n- **但 gateway 进程是今天 21:08 重启过一次**\\n  - 进程启动时间：`Tue Mar 17 21:08:44 2026`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 我查到的证据\\n\\n#### 1) 当前实际监听端口\\n`ss -ltnp` 看到：\\n\\n- `0.0.0.0:34459` → `openclaw-gateway`\\n- 另外还有：\\n  - `127.0.0.1:34461`\\n  - `127.0.0.1:34462`\\n\\n这里真正对外监听的是 **`34459`**。\\n\\n#### 2) 当前配置文件里的 gateway 端口\\nOpenClaw 配置里明确是：\\n\\n```json\\ngateway.port = 34459\\ngateway.bind = \\\"lan\\\"\\ngateway.mode = \\\"local\\\"\\n```\\n\\n#### 3) 配置文件最后修改时间\\n`openclaw.json` 里的元信息显示：\\n\\n- `lastTouchedVersion: 2026.3.8`\\n- `lastTouchedAt: 2026-03-14T06:52:08.974Z`\\n\\n这说明**至少从配置元信息看，不是我今天改的端口**。\\n\\n#### 4) 今天的本地 git / workspace 改动\\n今天的提交主要是：\\n\\n- memory\\n- heartbeat\\n- daily notes\\n\\n**没有看到我改 gateway 端口配置的记录。**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 但有一个值得注意的点\\n虽然**端口没变**，但 **gateway 进程在 21:08 重启过**。\\n\\n也就是说，如果你刚刚感觉“地址/连接状态变了”，更像是：\\n\\n- **gateway 重启了**\\n- 不像是**监听端口被改了**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 当前端口相关状态\\n- 对外监听：`34459`\\n- Control UI allowed origin 里也写的是：\\n  - `http://43.156.180.239:34459`\\n\\n所以整套配置现在是**一致的**，没出现“配置写一个、实际跑另一个”的情况。\\n\\n---\\n\\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你查：\\n\\n1. **是谁触发了 21:08 这次 gateway 重启**\\n2. **最近几分钟 gateway 日志里发生了什么**\\n3. **控制台/UI 为什么会让你怀疑端口变了**\\n\\n你回我一句 **“继续查重启原因”**，我就直接往下扒日志。\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b952b8638c819188203cec6b90b504\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773753008588\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Skills store policy (operator configured):\\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\\n\\n\\n[Tue 2026-03-17 21:16 GMT+8] 我在飞书渠道接收不到你的消息了，看看是什么原因\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1773753417554,\n      \"senderLabel\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"**Investigating skills and channels**\\n\\nI’m thinking about whether I need to read up on skills or if I might just need to search my memory for prior work. Actually, it seems that checking isn’t necessary right now. I wonder if I should look into the different channels available. Maybe I could use the openclaw status logs to gather some insights. It’s interesting how little bits come together! Let's see what I find.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"我先查 Feishu 通道状态和最近日志，看看是通道断了、重启后没接上，还是消息入站正常但出站有问题。\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b9544f12d481919f90316d01d79bfe\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_dUGASA3cYInbVjpl64jv5IlB|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b954503e5c819199525f8f80c443b0\",\n          \"name\": \"exec\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"command\": \"openclaw status --deep\",\n            \"workdir\": \"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\n            \"yieldMs\": 10000,\n            \"timeout\": 120\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"openclaw status --deep\\\",\\\"workdir\\\":\\\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\\\",\\\"yieldMs\\\":10000,\\\"timeout\\\":120}\"\n 