 have, the gateway was restarted. I might also mention that the config was last modified on March 14, 2026, and recent git commits are unrelated."},{"type":"text","text":" 查完了，结论先说：\n\n### 结论\n- **我今天没有改过 OpenClaw gateway 的监听端口**\n- **当前配置里的端口 = 实际监听端口 = `34459`**\n- **配置文件最近一次触碰时间不是今天**\n  - `meta.lastTouchedAt`: `2026-03-14T06:52:08.974Z`\n- **但 gateway 进程是今天 21:08 重启过一次**\n  - 进程启动时间：`Tue Mar 17 21:08:44 2026`\n\n---\n\n### 我查到的证据\n\n#### 1) 当前实际监听端口\n`ss -ltnp` 看到：\n\n- `0.0.0.0:34459` → `openclaw-gateway`\n- 另外还有：\n  - `127.0.0.1:34461`\n  - `127.0.0.1:34462`\n\n这里真正对外监听的是 **`34459`**。\n\n#### 2) 当前配置文件里的 gateway 端口\nOpenClaw 配置里明确是：\n\n```json\ngateway.port = 34459\ngateway.bind = \"lan\"\ngateway.mode = \"local\"\n```\n\n#### 3) 配置文件最后修改时间\n`openclaw.json` 里的元信息显示：\n\n- `lastTouchedVersion: 2026.3.8`\n- `lastTouchedAt: 2026-03-14T06:52:08.974Z`\n\n这说明**至少从配置元信息看，不是我今天改的端口**。\n\n#### 4) 今天的本地 git / workspace 改动\n今天的提交主要是：\n\n- memory\n- heartbeat\n- daily notes\n\n**没有看到我改 gateway 端口配置的记录。**\n\n---\n\n### 但有一个值得注意的点\n虽然**端口没变**，但 **gateway 进程在 21:08 重启过**。\n\n也就是说，如果你刚刚感觉“地址/连接状态变了”，更像是：\n\n- **gateway 重启了**\n- 不像是**监听端口被改了**\n\n---\n\n### 当前端口相关状态\n- 对外监听：`34459`\n- Control UI allowed origin 里也写的是：\n  - `http://43.156.180.239:34459`\n\n所以整套配置现在是**一致的**，没出现“配置写一个、实际跑另一个”的情况。\n\n---\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你查：\n\n1. **是谁触发了 21:08 这次 gateway 重启**\n2. **最近几分钟 gateway 日志里发生了什么**\n3. **控制台/UI 为什么会让你怀疑端口变了**\n\n你回我一句 **“继续查重启原因”**，我就直接往下扒日志。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b952b8638c819188203cec6b90b504\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773753008588},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\n\n[Tue 2026-03-17 21:16 GMT+8] 我在飞书渠道接收不到你的消息了，看看是什么原因"}],"timestamp":1773753417554,"senderLabel":"openclaw-control-ui"},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating skills and channels**\n\nI’m thinking about whether I need to read up on skills or if I might just need to search my memory for prior work. Actually, it seems that checking isn’t necessary right now. I wonder if I should look into the different channels available. Maybe I could use the openclaw status logs to gather some insights. It’s interesting how little bits come together! Let's see what I find."},{"type":"text","text":"我先查 Feishu 通道状态和最近日志，看看是通道断了、重启后没接上，还是消息入站正常但出站有问题。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b9544f12d481919f90316d01d79bfe\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dUGASA3cYInbVjpl64jv5IlB|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b954503e5c819199525f8f80c443b0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw status --deep","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw status --deep\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":120}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lQ8zKT9HKzJx94HKoco4BDiN|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b954503e6c81919bb96a9350f2b29e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw logs --help | sed -n '1,140p'","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":5000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw logs --help | sed -n '1,140p'\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":5000,\"timeout\":60}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bc71mfU5TLNEeFohrivbs9Bt|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b954503e