{"type":"message","id":"2b28040e","parentId":"6f4bb31e","timestamp":"2026-03-17T13:18:08.028Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nSystem: [2026-03-17 21:17:16 GMT+8] Exec completed (ember-gl, code 0) :: ────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ FAQ: https://docs.openclaw.ai/faq Troubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/tr…\n\nRead HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\nWhen reading HEARTBEAT.md, use workspace file /root/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md (exact case). Do not read docs/heartbeat.md.\nCurrent time: Tuesday, March 17th, 2026 — 9:18 PM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-03-17 13:18 UTC"}],"timestamp":1773753488015}}
