{"type":"message","id":"215724e8","parentId":"700373e2","timestamp":"2026-03-17T13:53:50.835Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5qTQrPn6UDohz1OfJBkkTjQf|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b95cee86a881919ba19065cdcf1e68","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"article-to-infographic\",\n  \"version\": \"2.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Transform articles into visually stunning HTML infographics with PNG export. v2.0 adds mandatory interaction workflow, fault-tolerant PNG export, Chinese typography optimization, and 6 style presets including Movie Poster and Chinese Anime.\",\n  \"author\": \"OpenClaw\",\n  \"entry\": \"SKILL.md\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"SKILL.md\",\n    \"references/style-presets.md\",\n    \"scripts/html_to_png.py\"\n  ],\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"optional\": [\n      \"playwright\",\n      \"selenium\",\n      \"wkhtmltopdf\",\n      \"cutycapt\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"styles\": [\n    \"bold-vibrant\",\n    \"clean-minimal\",\n    \"dark-techy\",\n    \"warm-editorial\",\n    \"movie-poster\",\n    \"chinese-anime\"\n  ],\n  \"features\": [\n    \"Mandatory interaction checkpoints (outline + style + export)\",\n    \"Fault-tolerant PNG export with 4-method fallback chain\",\n    \"CJK typography optimization with system font fallbacks\",\n    \"6 distinctive visual styles\",\n    \"Responsive design (4 breakpoints)\",\n    \"Print-ready output\"\n  ],\n  \"changelog\": {\n    \"2.0.0\": [\n      \"Added mandatory interaction workflow (MUST ask user for outline/style/export)\",\n      \"Implemented fault-tolerant PNG export (Playwright → Selenium → wkhtmltoimage → CutyCapt)\",\n      \"Added Chinese typography optimization (CJK line-height, punctuation, system fonts)\",\n      \"Added 2 new styles: movie-poster and chinese-anime\",\n      \"Improved font CDN with China mirrors (fonts.loli.net, fonts.font.im)\",\n      \"Added responsive breakpoints for mobile/tablet/desktop\"\n    ],\n    \"1.0.0\": [\n      \"Initial release with 4 base styles\",\n      \"Basic HTML infographic generation\",\n      \"Playwright-based PNG export\"\n    ]\n  }\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773755630824}}
{"type":"message","id":"75fa0738","parentId":"215724e8","timestamp":"2026-03-17T13:54:06.359Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已安装完成。\n\n### 安装结果\n- 安装来源：`skillhub`\n- 落地目录：\n  - `skills/article-to-infographic`\n\n安装输出原文：\n\n```text\ninfo: \"article-to-infographic\" not in index, using remote registry exact match\nDownloading: https://lightmake.site/api/v1/download?slug=article-to-infographic\nInstalled: article-to-infographic -> /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/article-to-infographic\n```\n\n---\n\n### 我复核到的情况\n正式安装后的包里，`skill.json` 仍然显示：\n\n- **version: `2.0.0`**\n- author: `OpenClaw`\n\n也就是说，**安装成功了，但版本冲突问题依旧存在**：\n\n- `skillhub search` 显示：`1.0.0`\n- 实际包内 `skill.json`：`2.0.0`\n\n这点我继续保留风险提示，不装作没看见。\n\n---\n\n### 当前工作区状态\n现在 git 状态里有这些未提交变更：\n\n- `?? skills/article-to-infographic/`\n- `M memory/2026-03-17.md`\n- `M memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\n其中后两项看起来是 heartbeat / 今日记录顺手更新造成的，不是这个 skill 本身的问题。\n\n---\n\n### 你现在可以怎么用\n这个 skill 主要是：\n\n- 把文章 / 文本 / URL\n- 转成 **HTML infographic**\n- 可选再导出 **PNG**\n\n但它的使用规则比较严格：  \n**默认要求分步骤确认**（大纲、布局/风格、输出格式）。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你**实战跑一次**。  \n你只要给我下面任意一种输入：\n\n1. **一篇文章链接**\n2. **一段文章正文**\n3. **一个本地文件路径**\n\n我就按这个 skill 开始做。  \n如果你想省事，我也可以直接走它文档里的“参数化模式”，一次性帮你定：\n\n- Layout\n- Style\n- Illustrations\n- Output format\n\n你直接发我内容，我就开做。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b95cf344f88191a0a770be5fd5e114\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":83617,"output":478,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85631,"cost":{"input":0.20904250000000002,"output":0.00717,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.21659650000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773755630829}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca8aee25","parentId":"75fa0738","timestamp":"2026-03-17T14:03:07.087Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54a1bf52c0acb26fe069cbf7fa9\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-17 22:03 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54a1bf52c0acb26fe069cbf7fa9]\n范: 你把今天对自己的提升和优化，用这个技能总结成图片出来，直接生成一份html给我，不用问太多废话，风格你自己定，我要用来发到小红书的，所以html里最好有多张图片，这样我打开html后进行截图"}],"timestamp":1773756187078}}
