ncluded. I'll want to keep it brief to ensure clarity. After putting everything together, I can send the information via message and ensure there's no reply expected. It's important to keep it streamlined!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我重做一版：按 **3:4 竖版卡片** 来排，每页更强调**流程图、结构图、前后对比、时间线**，少堆文字。做完直接把 HTML 发你。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96076a8008191a2db262254031e41\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02yv0zDHJGFKbiSGkdXiprWN|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077bed88191badbf38f0fbd377b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-17.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-17.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_N89htbwMCpTxcu4OPweZl5zi|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077beec8191915be9fe0eee934e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"git log --oneline --since='2026-03-17 00:00' --all","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":5000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"git log --oneline --since='2026-03-17 00:00' --all\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":5000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_QdgJvHxhIkEMngK2WmYv2kPm|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077bef88191a501d32f138dc8d4","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":94290,"output":229,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96055,"cost":{"input":0.23572500000000002,"output":0.003435,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.239544}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773756528585}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd872392","parentId":"7bb2ed8a","timestamp":"2026-03-17T14:08:56.021Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02yv0zDHJGFKbiSGkdXiprWN|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077bed88191badbf38f0fbd377b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-17\n\n## 今日初始化\n- 初始化 `memory/` 目录\n- 创建 `MEMORY.md` 作为长期记忆文件\n- 计划整理当前工作区并做一次 git 提交\n\n## 今日状态\n- OpenClaw 状态巡检完成：Feishu 渠道正常，当前会话正常\n- 发现工作区存在未跟踪文件与本地状态文件，需要整理\n- OpenClaw 提示有可用更新：npm 2026.3.13\n\n## 待跟进\n- 评估是否升级 OpenClaw\n- 持续沉淀长期记忆与日常记录习惯\n- [x] 补齐 memory 体系：新增 `memory/README.md`、`memory/TEMPLATE.md`、`memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\n## 决策 / 结论\n- 长期信息写入 `MEMORY.md`，每日过程写入 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- heartbeat 检查状态统一记录在 `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n- heartbeat 默认执行低打扰巡检，无新增信息时直接返回 `HEARTBEAT_OK`\n- “处理一下今天的事”默认可按 `memory/TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md` 输出\n\n## 已完成\n- 新增 `HEARTBEAT.md` 实用巡检规则\n- 新增 `memory/MEMORY-RULES.md`\n- 新增 `memory/TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md`\n- 执行八次 heartbeat 检查（12:03, 13:32, 16:02, 18:02, 18:32, 19:32, 20:32, 22:00），均无需要立即提醒的事项\n  - 22:00 天气检查：上海 ☁️ +12°C\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773756536008}}
{"type":"message","id":"f99b535f","parentId":"dd872392","timestamp":"2026-03-17T14:08:56.032Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_N89htbwMCpTxcu4OPweZl5zi|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077beec8191915be9fe0eee934e","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"b5616f4 Update heartbeat state and daily notes\n6395c9a Update heartbeat state after 14:34 check\n522e322 Update heartbeat state and daily memory\nbbca8b9 Refine memory workflows and heartbeat rules\n080f3ba Complete memory system scaffolding\n1ee8205 Initialize workspace memory and organize tracked files"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":21,"aggregated":"b5616f4 Update heartbeat state and daily notes\n6395c9a Update heartbeat state after 14:34 check\n522e322 Update heartbeat state and daily memory\nbbca8b9 Refine memory workflows and heartbeat rules\n080f3ba Complete memory system scaffolding\n1ee8205 Initialize workspace memory and organize tracked files","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773756536030}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c71558b","parentId":"f99b535f","timestamp":"2026-03-17T14:08:56.049Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_QdgJvHxhIkEMngK2WmYv2kPm|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b96077bef88191a501d32f138dc8d4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# MEMORY.md\n\n## 用户画像\n- 姓名称呼：范总；对话中称呼为**主人**\n- 身份：个人开发者、公众号博主、内容创业者\n- 工作环境：macOS 为主，配合多台云服务器协同\n- 时区：Asia/Shanghai（东八区）\n- 作息偏好：工作时间 8:00-21:00，不熬夜\n\n## 沟通偏好\n- 结论先行，少铺垫\n- 简洁直接，拒绝冗余客套\n- 优先中文；专业术语可保留 English\n- 技术问题偏好短句、强实操、少空话\n- 不喜欢模糊表达，避免“可能 / 也许”这类词\n- 希望拿到可直接落地的方案，而不是泛泛建议\n\n## 工作节奏\n- 每日晨报：9 点前推送\n- 重要事项：立即通知\n- 常规汇报：每日早上汇总一次\n- 紧急联系：飞书可唤醒\n\n## 关注方向\n- AI 编程入门到进阶\n- 当前项目：小程序、网站\n- 计划方向：使用 AI 开发 iOS 应用\n- 持续产出原创内容，重视选题、效率、节奏管理\n\n## 生活与兴趣\n- 每天至少 1 杯咖啡\n- 关注养生：每日金刚功、饭后散步\n- 科技爱好者\n- 对道家、修仙、玄学题材有兴趣\n- 不抽烟，少喝酒\n\n## 协作原则\n- 未确认前，不执行破坏性删除或高风险修改\n- 不泄露私人代码、未发布内容、密码或密钥\n- 涉及对外发送、上传、公开发布时，默认谨慎，必要时先确认\n- 输出以“能直接用”为标准：步骤清楚、配置明确、少废话\n\n## 工作区与助理状态\n- 基础人格与协作文件已建立：`AGENTS.md`、`SOUL.md`、`USER.md`、`IDENTITY.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`HEARTBEAT.md`\n- `memory/` 机制于 2026-03-17 初始化\n- 已建立长期记忆文件 `MEMORY.md`\n- 已完成一次工作区整理，并提交 git：`c4f15ed` `Initialize workspace memory and organize tracked files`\n\n## 待持续维护\n- 将重要项目决策、长期偏好、固定工作流沉淀到此文件\n- 将每日发生的具体事项记录到 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 定期从日记中提炼长期有效信息，避免 MEMORY.md 变成流水账\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773756536035}}
{"type":"message","id":"f8e3c87f","parentId":"8c71558b","timestamp":"2026-03-17T14:10:56.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我直接重做成 **3:4 竖版多页册子**：每页就是一张小红书图，重点放流程和结构图，不再写成大段文字海报。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b9607a69588191801cef66502487bd\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_WOmB69MXapzFqf9LN4GAA3cQ|fc_05aa080dcd1a51c40169b9607b78988191af871da808e879a8","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>AI 助手今日升级手册｜3:4 流程图版</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.loli.net\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.loli.net/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;800;900&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    :root{\n      --bg:#f5f7fb;\n      --paper:#ffffff;\n      --ink:#101828;\n      --muted:#667085;\n      --line:#e4e7ec;\n      --purple:#7357ff;\n      --blue:#38bdf8;\n      --green:#34d399;\n      --orange:#fb923c;\n      --red:#fb7185;\n      --shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(16,24,40,.10);\n      --radius:28px;\n    }\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#edf2ff 0%,#f8fafc 100%);\n      color:var(--ink);\n      font-family:\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n      padding:24px 0 60px;\n    }\n    .book{width:min(1200px,calc(100vw - 24px));margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:22px}\n    .page{\n      width:min(900px,calc(100vw - 24px));\n      aspect-ratio:3/4;\n      margin:0 auto;\n      background:var(--paper);\n      border:1px solid rgba(16,24,40,.06);\n      box-shadow:var(--shadow);\n      border-radius:34px;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .page::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;inset:0;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(115,87,255,.10), transparent 25%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(56,189,248,.10), transparent 20%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 100%, rgba(52,211,153,.08), transparent 20%);\n      pointer-events:none;\n    }\n    .inner{position:relative;z-index:1;height:100%;padding:34px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n    .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;background:#eef2ff;color:#4737c9;border:1px solid #dfe4ff}\n    .page-no{font-weight:800;color:#98a2b3;font-size:13px}\n    .title{font-family:\"Noto Serif SC\",serif;font-size:50px;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:6px 0 0}\n    .title.sm{font-size:38px}\n    .sub{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467;margin:14px 0 0}\n    .cover-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:18px;margin-top:24px;flex:1}\n    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:20px}\n    .card.soft{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fafaff 0%,#f6f8ff 100%)}\n    .big-number{font-size:58px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:var(--purple)}\n    .tiny{font-size:13px;color:#667085;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}\n    .text{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#344054}\n    .stack{display:grid;gap:16px}\n    .list{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\n    .item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fcfcfd;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#344054}\n    .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\n    .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\n    .metric{padding:18px;border-radius:22px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n    .metric .k{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px}\n    .metric:nth-child(1) .k{color:var(--purple)}\n    .metric:nth-child(2) .k{color:var(--blue)}\n    .metric:nth-child(3) .k{color:var(--green)}\n    .metric:nth-child(4) .k{color:var(--orange)}\n    .flow{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\n    .node{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:start;padding:16px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}\n    .num{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--purple),var(--blue))}\n    .node h3{margin:2px 0 8px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3}\n    .node p{margin:0;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}\n    .arrow{height:22px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:#98a2b3;font-weight:900;font-size:20px}\n    .compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\n    .panel{border-radius:24px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n    .panel.before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff6f7 0%,#fffafb 100%)}\n    .panel.after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f3fbff 0%,#f9feff 100%)}\n    .panel h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px}\n    .bullet{display:grid;gap:10px}\n    .bullet div{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;border:1px solid rgba(16,24,40,.05)}\n    .diagram{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:20px}\n    .box{border-radius:22px;padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:150px}\n    .box .hd{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:10px}\n    .box .bd{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#475467}\n    .linechain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 1fr 80px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}\n    .chainbox{padding:18px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;text-align:center}\n    .chainbox .a{font-size:16px;color:#667085;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:800}\n    .chainbox .b{font-size:22px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.4}\n    .chainarrow{text-align:center;font-size:28px;color:#98a2b3;font-weight:900}\n    .timeline{position:relative;margin-top:18px;padding-left:18px;display:grid;gap:16px}\n    .timeline:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:4px;bottom:4px;width:4px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--purple),var(--green))}\n    .t{position:relative;padding:14px 16px 14px 18px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}\n    .t:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-25px;top:18px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--purple);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(115,87,255,.15)}\n    .t .time{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#7a5af8;margin-bottom:6px}\n    .t .desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#344054}\n    .hero-process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:22px;flex:1}\n    .steps4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}\n    .s{border-radius:22px;padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n    .s .n{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#7a5af8;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}\n    .s .tt{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px}\n    .s .dd{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467}\n    .footer{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:#98a2b3;text-align:right;font-weight:700}\n    .caption{font-size:14px;color:#667085;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7}\n    .cover-note{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467;margin-top:14px}\n    @media (max-width:930px){\n      .page{width:calc(100vw - 20px)}\n      .inner{padding:20px}\n      .title{font-size:34px}.title.sm{font-size:28px}.sub{font-size:16px}\n      .cover-grid,.grid2,.compare,.hero-process,.diagram,.linechain,.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n      .linechain{gap:12px}.chainarrow{transform:rotate(90deg)}\n      .page{aspect-ratio:auto}\n    }\n    @media print{\n      body{background:#fff;padding:0}.page{box-shadow:none;margin:0 auto 16px;page-break-after:always}\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"book\">\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\">\n          <div class=\"pill\">AI 助手升级手册 · 小红书 3:4 版</div>\n          <div class=\"page-no\">01 / 08</div>\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"title\">今天，我把自己的 AI 助手重新打磨成了一本“流程册”。</h1>\n        <p class=\"sub\">重点不是写了多少字，而是把 <strong>记忆、心跳、巡检、安装、留痕</strong> 这些能力，改造成了可以长期复用的工作流。</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-process\">\n          <div class=\"card soft\">\n            <div class=\"tiny\">今日升级主轴</div>\n            <div class=\"linechain\">\n              <div class=\"chainbox\"><div class=\"a\">Step 1</div><div class=\"b\">整理工作区</div></div>\n              <div class=\"chainarrow\">→</div>\n              <div class=\"chainbox\"><div class=\"a\">Step 2</div><div class=\"b\">补齐记忆系统</div></div>\n              <div class=\"chainarrow\">→</div>\n              <div class=\"chainbox\"><div class=\"a\">Step 3</div><div class=\"b\">跑通巡检与技能</div></div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"cover-note\">今天不是“临时做完几件事”，而是把底层机制真正补成了一套闭环。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"big-number\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"text\">次关键 git 提交，把今天的优化全部留档。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"big-number\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">8</div>\n              <div class=\"text\">次 heartbeat 实跑，且都遵守低打扰原则。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"big-number\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">1</div>\n              <div class=\"text\">套完整 memory 机制，从 daily 到长期记忆全部串起来。</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">打开 HTML 后按页截图即可</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">流程一：把记忆系统做成闭环</div><div class=\"page-no\">02 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">今天最核心的升级：把“记不住”变成“可沉淀”。</h2>\n        <div class=\"flow\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>建长期记忆</h3><p>创建 <strong>MEMORY.md</strong>，固定用户画像、沟通偏好、工作节奏、协作原则。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>建每日记录</h3><p>创建 <strong>memory/2026-03-17.md</strong>，记录当天完成项、决策、待跟进事项。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>补规则与模板</h3><p>补齐 <strong>README / TEMPLATE / MEMORY-RULES / TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE</strong>，明确怎么记、记到哪。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><div><h3>嵌入启动流程</h3><p>在 <strong>AGENTS.md</strong> 里规定：每天开工先读 today + yesterday；今天文件不存在就从模板自动创建。</p></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">这一步的本质：从“靠脑补”切换到“靠文件持续接力”。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">流程二：Heartbeat 从摆设变成巡检系统</div><div class=\"page-no\">03 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">不是定时吵你，而是按规则筛选“值不值得提醒”。</h2>\n        <div class=\"compare\">\n          <div class=\"panel before\">\n            <h3>改造前</h3>\n            <div class=\"bullet\">\n              <div>Heartbeat 只是占位。</div>\n              <div>没有检查优先级。</div>\n              <div>没有状态记录。</div>\n              <div>容易重复提醒、制造噪音。</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"panel after\">\n            <h3>改造后</h3>\n            <div class=\"bullet\">\n              <div>先看 <strong>heartbeat-state.json</strong>。</div>\n              <div>每次最多检查 1-2 项。</div>\n              <div>优先 calendar / email / mentions / weather。</div>\n              <div>无新情况时，直接 <strong>HEARTBEAT_OK</strong>。</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"diagram\">\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">输入</div><div class=\"bd\">heartbeat 触发 → 读取 HEARTBEAT.md 规则</div></div>\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">判断</div><div class=\"bd\">看检查间隔、时间段、有没有新信息</div></div>\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">输出</div><div class=\"bd\">有事提醒；没事闭嘴，不刷存在感</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">今天实际跑了 8 次 heartbeat，全部按“低打扰、高价值”执行。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">流程三：工作区整理成长期可维护状态</div><div class=\"page-no\">04 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">把杂乱文件、运行态垃圾、临时状态，重新分层管理。</h2>\n        <div class=\"steps4\" style=\"margin-top:18px;flex:1\">\n          <div class=\"s\"><div class=\"n\">step 1</div><div class=\"tt\">先看 git 状态</div><div class=\"dd\">不盲改。修改前先确认分支和工作区状态。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"s\"><div class=\"n\">step 2</div><div class=\"tt\">加 .gitignore</div><div class=\"dd\">把 `.openclaw/`、`.clawhub/`、`logs/` 等运行态文件从正式版本管理中排除。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"s\"><div class=\"n\">step 3</div><div class=\"tt\">危险文件不硬删</div><div class=\"dd\">把完成使命的 `BOOTSTRAP.md` 移到 `.trash/`，保留可恢复能力。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"s\"><div class=\"n\">step 4</div><div class=\"tt\">关键优化立刻提交</div><div class=\"dd\">把每一步结构化优化做成 git 提交，不让成果只留在聊天记录里。</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n          <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"k\">1ee8205</div><div class=\"text\">初始化 memory 与 tracked files</div></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"k\">080f3ba</div><div class=\"text\">完成 memory 脚手架</div></div>\n          <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"k\">bbca8b9</div><div class=\"text\">细化 heartbeat 与 memory 规则</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">流程四：安装 skill，不再“先装了再说”</div><div class=\"page-no\">05 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">今天把 skill 安装流程也补成了：先搜、先审、再装。</h2>\n        <div class=\"flow\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h3>先搜</h3><p>按规则先执行 <strong>skillhub search article-to-infographic</strong>，确认 registry 中是否有命中。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h3>先拉临时目录审查</h3><p>不直接装进正式 `skills/`，而是先下载到临时目录查看 <strong>SKILL.md / skill.json / scripts</strong>。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h3>看风险信号</h3><p>发现 <strong>search 版本 1.0.0</strong> 与 <strong>包内 2.0.0</strong> 不一致，且脚本会自动 `pip install playwright`。</p></div></div>\n          <div class=\"arrow\">↓</div>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><div><h3>给风险等级再安装</h3><p>结论：<strong>中风险，可谨慎安装</strong>。你确认后，我才正式落地到 `skills/article-to-infographic/`。</p></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">流程五：巡检与排障不再停留在“看起来正常”</div><div class=\"page-no\">06 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">今天还顺手走通了一次 OpenClaw 深度巡检与故障定位路径。</h2>\n        <div class=\"timeline\">\n          <div class=\"t\"><div class=\"time\">STEP A</div><div class=\"desc\">先跑 <strong>openclaw status --deep</strong>，确认 Gateway reachable、Feishu OK、核心链路通畅。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"t\"><div class=\"time\">STEP B</div><div class=\"desc\">再看监听端口与配置：确认实际监听和配置中的 <strong>34459</strong> 是一致的。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"t\"><div class=\"time\">STEP C</div><div class=\"desc\">排查飞书消息异常时，不是直接猜“通道挂了”，而是继续看日志链路。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"t\"><div class=\"time\">STEP D</div><div class=\"desc\">最终定位到：<strong>21:15 的 gateway SIGTERM 重启</strong> 更像是打断了出站回复，而不是飞书整体失效。</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">这类排查的价值不是多跑命令，而是把“配置、端口、通道、重启、消息投递”一层层拆开。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">今天的优化结果，用一张结构图看完</div><div class=\"page-no\">07 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">我今天不是“多学了点”，而是把自己从工具，推进成了流程型助手。</h2>\n        <div class=\"diagram\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;flex:1\">\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">输入层</div><div class=\"bd\">用户偏好、今日任务、通道状态、heartbeat 信号、skill 请求</div></div>\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">处理中台</div><div class=\"bd\">MEMORY.md + daily notes + HEARTBEAT 规则 + git 留痕 + skill 审查</div></div>\n          <div class=\"box\"><div class=\"hd\">输出层</div><div class=\"bd\">更稳定的回复、更少的重复确认、更清晰的巡检、更可复用的工作流</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"compare\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">\n          <div class=\"panel before\"><h3>以前更像</h3><div class=\"bullet\"><div>会做单点任务的聊天助手</div><div>很多过程靠临时状态</div><div>容易把经验留在对话里</div></div></div>\n          <div class=\"panel after\"><h3>现在更像</h3><div class=\"bullet\"><div>能长期协作的流程型助手</div><div>会把经验沉淀成文件和规则</div><div>会先审查，再执行高影响动作</div></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"top\"><div class=\"pill\">适合发小红书的最后一页</div><div class=\"page-no\">08 / 08</div></div>\n        <h2 class=\"title sm\">今天最大的变化：我不只是“更会回答”，而是“更会长期配合工作”了。</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:18px;flex:1\">\n          <div class=\"card soft\">\n            <div class=\"tiny\">可直接拿去当标题</div>\n            <div class=\"list\">\n              <div class=\"item\">我今天把 AI 助手重新打磨了一轮，它终于开始像“工作搭子”了</div>\n              <div class=\"item\">别只盯着 AI 会不会回答，真正值钱的是这套底层工作流</div>\n              <div class=\"item\">把 OpenClaw 助手从“能用”优化到“能长期协作”，我今天做了什么？</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <div class=\"tiny\">可直接拿去当文案结尾</div>\n            <div class=\"list\">\n              <div class=\"item\">今天没追新模型，反而把记忆、巡检、规则、留痕这些底层能力补齐了。</div>\n              <div class=\"item\">真正有价值的 AI，不是偶尔聪明一下，而是每天都在变得更稳、更省心。</div>\n              <div class=\"item\">下一步，我会继续把它从“助手”打磨成真正能独立接住长期工作的系统。</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">这版已按 3:4 竖图比例制作，适合逐页截图发图文</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/Drafts/2026-03-17-openclaw-self-upgrade-xhs-3x4-process.html\",\"content\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n  <title>AI 助手今日升级手册｜3:4 流程图版</title>\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.loli.net\\\">\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n  <link href=\\\"https://fonts.loli.net/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700;800;900&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#f5f7fb;\\n      --paper:#ffffff;\\n      --ink:#101828;\\n      --muted:#667085;\\n      --line:#e4e7ec;\\n      --purple:#7357ff;\\n      --blue:#38bdf8;\\n      --green:#34d399;\\n      --orange:#fb923c;\\n      --red:#fb7185;\\n      --shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(16,24,40,.10);\\n      --radius:28px;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;\\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#edf2ff 0%,#f8fafc 100%);\\n      color:var(--ink);\\n      font-family:\\\"Noto Sans SC\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n      padding:24px 0 60px;\\n    }\\n    .book{width:min(1200px,calc(100vw - 24px));margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:22px}\\n    .page{\\n      width:min(900px,calc(100vw - 24px));\\n      aspect-ratio:3/4;\\n      margin:0 auto;\\n      background:var(--paper);\\n      border:1px solid rgba(16,24,40,.06);\\n      box-shadow:var(--shadow);\\n      border-radius:34px;\\n      overflow:hidden;\\n      position:relative;\\n    }\\n    .page::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";\\n      position:absolute;inset:0;\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(115,87,255,.10), transparent 25%),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(56,189,248,.10), transparent 20%),\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 100%, rgba(52,211,153,.08), transparent 20%);\\n      pointer-events:none;\\n    }\\n    .inner{position:relative;z-index:1;height:100%;padding:34px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n    .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;background:#eef2ff;color:#4737c9;border:1px solid #dfe4ff}\\n    .page-no{font-weight:800;color:#98a2b3;font-size:13px}\\n    .title{font-family:\\\"Noto Serif SC\\\",serif;font-size:50px;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:6px 0 0}\\n    .title.sm{font-size:38px}\\n    .sub{font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467;margin:14px 0 0}\\n    .cover-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:18px;margin-top:24px;flex:1}\\n    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:20px}\\n    .card.soft{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fafaff 0%,#f6f8ff 100%)}\\n    .big-number{font-size:58px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:var(--purple)}\\n    .tiny{font-size:13px;color:#667085;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}\\n    .text{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#344054}\\n    .stack{display:grid;gap:16px}\\n    .list{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fcfcfd;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#344054}\\n    .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\\n    .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .metric{padding:18px;border-radius:22px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line)}\\n    .metric .k{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .metric:nth-child(1) .k{color:var(--purple)}\\n    .metric:nth-child(2) .k{color:var(--blue)}\\n    .metric:nth-child(3) .k{color:var(--green)}\\n    .metric:nth-child(4) .k{color:var(--orange)}\\n    .flow{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .node{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:start;padding:16px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}\\n    .num{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--purple),var(--blue))}\\n    .node h3{margin:2px 0 8px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3}\\n    .node p{margin:0;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}\\n    .arrow{height:22px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:#98a2b3;font-weight:900;font-size:20px}\\n    .compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .panel{border-radius:24px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\\n    .panel.before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff6f7 0%,#fffafb 100%)}\\n    .panel.after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f3fbff 0%,#f9feff 100%)}\\n    .panel h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px}\\n    .bullet{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .bullet div{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;border:1px solid rgba(16,24,40,.05)}\\n    .diagram{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .box{border-radius:22px;padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:150px}\\n    .box .hd{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .box .bd{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#475467}\\n    .linechain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 1fr 80px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}\\n    .chainbox{padding:18px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;text-align:center}\\n    .chainbox .a{font-size:16px;color:#667085;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:800}\\n    .chainbox .b{font-size:22px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.4}\\n    .chainarrow{text-align:center;font-size:28px;color:#98a2b3;font-weight:900}\\n    .timeline{position:relative;margin-top:18px;padding-left:18px;display:grid;gap:16px}\\n    .timeline:before{content:\\\"\\\";position:absolute;left:0;top:4px;bottom:4px;width:4px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--purple),var(--green))}\\n    .t{position:relative;padding:14px 16px 14px 18px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}\\n    .t:before{content:\\\"\\\";position:absolute;left:-25px;top:18px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--purple);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(115,87,255,.15)}\\n    .t .time{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#7a5af8;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    .t .desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#344054}\\n    .hero-process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:22px;flex:1}\\n    .steps4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .s{border-radius:22px;padding:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)}\\n    .s .n{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#7a5af8;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .s .tt{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .s .dd{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467}\\n    .footer{margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:#98a2b3;text-align:right;font-weight:700}\\n    .caption{font-size:14px;color:#667085;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.7}\\n    .cover-note{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#475467;margin-top:14px}\\n    @media (max-width:930px){\\n      .page{width:calc(100vw - 20px)}\\n      .inner{padding:20px}\\n      .title{font-size:34px}.title.sm{font-size:28px}.sub{font-size:16px}\\n      .cover-grid,.grid2,.compare,.hero-process,.diagram,.linechain,.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .linechain{gap:12px}.chainarrow{transform:rotate(90deg)}\\n      .page{aspect-ratio:auto}\\n    }\\n    @media print{\\n      body{background:#fff;padding:0}.page{box-shadow:none;margin:0 auto 16px;page-break-after:always}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"book\\\">\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">AI 助手升级手册 · 小红书 3:4 版</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"page-no\\\">01 / 08</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"title\\\">今天，我把自己的 AI 助手重新打磨成了一本“流程册”。</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"sub\\\">重点不是写了多少字，而是把 <strong>记忆、心跳、巡检、安装、留痕</strong> 这些能力，改造成了可以长期复用的工作流。</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"hero-process\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card soft\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">今日升级主轴</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"linechain\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"chainbox\\\"><div class=\\\"a\\\">Step 1</div><div class=\\\"b\\\">整理工作区</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"chainarrow\\\">→</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"chainbox\\\"><div class=\\\"a\\\">Step 2</div><div class=\\\"b\\\">补齐记忆系统</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"chainarrow\\\">→</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"chainbox\\\"><div class=\\\"a\\\">Step 3</div><div class=\\\"b\\\">跑通巡检与技能</div></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"cover-note\\\">今天不是“临时做完几件事”，而是把底层机制真正补成了一套闭环。</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"stack\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"big-number\\\">3</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text\\\">次关键 git 提交，把今天的优化全部留档。</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"big-number\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--blue)\\\">8</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text\\\">次 heartbeat 实跑，且都遵守低打扰原则。</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"big-number\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--green)\\\">1</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"text\\\">套完整 memory 机制，从 daily 到长期记忆全部串起来。</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"footer\\\">打开 HTML 后按页截图即可</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">流程一：把记忆系统做成闭环</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">02 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">今天最核心的升级：把“记不住”变成“可沉淀”。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"flow\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><h3>建长期记忆</h3><p>创建 <strong>MEMORY.md</strong>，固定用户画像、沟通偏好、工作节奏、协作原则。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><h3>建每日记录</h3><p>创建 <strong>memory/2026-03-17.md</strong>，记录当天完成项、决策、待跟进事项。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><h3>补规则与模板</h3><p>补齐 <strong>README / TEMPLATE / MEMORY-RULES / TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE</strong>，明确怎么记、记到哪。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">4</div><div><h3>嵌入启动流程</h3><p>在 <strong>AGENTS.md</strong> 里规定：每天开工先读 today + yesterday；今天文件不存在就从模板自动创建。</p></div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"caption\\\">这一步的本质：从“靠脑补”切换到“靠文件持续接力”。</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">流程二：Heartbeat 从摆设变成巡检系统</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">03 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">不是定时吵你，而是按规则筛选“值不值得提醒”。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"compare\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"panel before\\\">\\n            <h3>改造前</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"bullet\\\">\\n              <div>Heartbeat 只是占位。</div>\\n              <div>没有检查优先级。</div>\\n              <div>没有状态记录。</div>\\n              <div>容易重复提醒、制造噪音。</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"panel after\\\">\\n            <h3>改造后</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"bullet\\\">\\n              <div>先看 <strong>heartbeat-state.json</strong>。</div>\\n              <div>每次最多检查 1-2 项。</div>\\n              <div>优先 calendar / email / mentions / weather。</div>\\n              <div>无新情况时，直接 <strong>HEARTBEAT_OK</strong>。</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"diagram\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">输入</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">heartbeat 触发 → 读取 HEARTBEAT.md 规则</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">判断</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">看检查间隔、时间段、有没有新信息</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">输出</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">有事提醒；没事闭嘴，不刷存在感</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"caption\\\">今天实际跑了 8 次 heartbeat，全部按“低打扰、高价值”执行。</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">流程三：工作区整理成长期可维护状态</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">04 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">把杂乱文件、运行态垃圾、临时状态，重新分层管理。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"steps4\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px;flex:1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"s\\\"><div class=\\\"n\\\">step 1</div><div class=\\\"tt\\\">先看 git 状态</div><div class=\\\"dd\\\">不盲改。修改前先确认分支和工作区状态。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"s\\\"><div class=\\\"n\\\">step 2</div><div class=\\\"tt\\\">加 .gitignore</div><div class=\\\"dd\\\">把 `.openclaw/`、`.clawhub/`、`logs/` 等运行态文件从正式版本管理中排除。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"s\\\"><div class=\\\"n\\\">step 3</div><div class=\\\"tt\\\">危险文件不硬删</div><div class=\\\"dd\\\">把完成使命的 `BOOTSTRAP.md` 移到 `.trash/`，保留可恢复能力。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"s\\\"><div class=\\\"n\\\">step 4</div><div class=\\\"tt\\\">关键优化立刻提交</div><div class=\\\"dd\\\">把每一步结构化优化做成 git 提交，不让成果只留在聊天记录里。</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><div class=\\\"k\\\">1ee8205</div><div class=\\\"text\\\">初始化 memory 与 tracked files</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><div class=\\\"k\\\">080f3ba</div><div class=\\\"text\\\">完成 memory 脚手架</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"metric\\\"><div class=\\\"k\\\">bbca8b9</div><div class=\\\"text\\\">细化 heartbeat 与 memory 规则</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">流程四：安装 skill，不再“先装了再说”</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">05 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">今天把 skill 安装流程也补成了：先搜、先审、再装。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"flow\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><h3>先搜</h3><p>按规则先执行 <strong>skillhub search article-to-infographic</strong>，确认 registry 中是否有命中。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><h3>先拉临时目录审查</h3><p>不直接装进正式 `skills/`，而是先下载到临时目录查看 <strong>SKILL.md / skill.json / scripts</strong>。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><h3>看风险信号</h3><p>发现 <strong>search 版本 1.0.0</strong> 与 <strong>包内 2.0.0</strong> 不一致，且脚本会自动 `pip install playwright`。</p></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"arrow\\\">↓</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"node\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">4</div><div><h3>给风险等级再安装</h3><p>结论：<strong>中风险，可谨慎安装</strong>。你确认后，我才正式落地到 `skills/article-to-infographic/`。</p></div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">流程五：巡检与排障不再停留在“看起来正常”</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">06 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">今天还顺手走通了一次 OpenClaw 深度巡检与故障定位路径。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"timeline\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><div class=\\\"time\\\">STEP A</div><div class=\\\"desc\\\">先跑 <strong>openclaw status --deep</strong>，确认 Gateway reachable、Feishu OK、核心链路通畅。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><div class=\\\"time\\\">STEP B</div><div class=\\\"desc\\\">再看监听端口与配置：确认实际监听和配置中的 <strong>34459</strong> 是一致的。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><div class=\\\"time\\\">STEP C</div><div class=\\\"desc\\\">排查飞书消息异常时，不是直接猜“通道挂了”，而是继续看日志链路。</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"t\\\"><div class=\\\"time\\\">STEP D</div><div class=\\\"desc\\\">最终定位到：<strong>21:15 的 gateway SIGTERM 重启</strong> 更像是打断了出站回复，而不是飞书整体失效。</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"caption\\\">这类排查的价值不是多跑命令，而是把“配置、端口、通道、重启、消息投递”一层层拆开。</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">今天的优化结果，用一张结构图看完</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">07 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">我今天不是“多学了点”，而是把自己从工具，推进成了流程型助手。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"diagram\\\" style=\\\"grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;flex:1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">输入层</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">用户偏好、今日任务、通道状态、heartbeat 信号、skill 请求</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">处理中台</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">MEMORY.md + daily notes + HEARTBEAT 规则 + git 留痕 + skill 审查</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"hd\\\">输出层</div><div class=\\\"bd\\\">更稳定的回复、更少的重复确认、更清晰的巡检、更可复用的工作流</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"compare\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"panel before\\\"><h3>以前更像</h3><div class=\\\"bullet\\\"><div>会做单点任务的聊天助手</div><div>很多过程靠临时状态</div><div>容易把经验留在对话里</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"panel after\\\"><h3>现在更像</h3><div class=\\\"bullet\\\"><div>能长期协作的流程型助手</div><div>会把经验沉淀成文件和规则</div><div>会先审查，再执行高影响动作</div></div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"page\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"top\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">适合发小红书的最后一页</div><div class=\\\"page-no\\\">08 / 08</div></div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title sm\\\">今天最大的变化：我不只是“更会回答”，而是“更会长期配合工作”了。</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid2\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px;flex:1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card soft\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">可直接拿去当标题</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">我今天把 AI 助手重新打磨了一轮，它终于开始像“工作搭子”了</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">别只盯着 AI 会不会回答，真正值钱的是这套底层工作流</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">把 OpenClaw 助手从“能用”优化到“能长期协作”，我今天做了什么？</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"tiny\\\">可直接拿去当文案结尾</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">今天没追新模型，反而把记忆、巡检、规则、留痕这些底层能力补齐了。</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">真正有价值的 AI，不是偶尔聪明一下，而是每天都在变得更稳、更省心。</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"item\\\">下一步，我会继续把它从“助手”打磨成真正能独立接住长期工作的系统。</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"footer\\\">这版已按 3:4 竖图比例制作，适合逐页截图发图文</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"}"}],"api":"openai